{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさまこんばんは！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"北野日奈子です(｡・・｡)♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日も朝からスイカをたくさん食べて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スイカを口に入れてもぐもぐしてる時に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「おいしい～」と声の音だけで言ったら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お母さんに笑われました！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな中、リビングの階段を下りてくる妹に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「スイカの美味しさがわからない」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って言われました( ˘ｰωｰ˘ )笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"妹は桃とかの方が好きみたい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一年中スイカを食べていたい(｡・・｡)！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/08/15/7039293/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/08/15/7039293/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/08/15/7039293/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"8月もあと半分！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっという間ですね～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この間、7月終わっちゃう～って言ってたのに！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎日いろいろなことがあって\n1つ1つをこなしてるうちに\nあっという間に時間が過ぎていってる！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんななか、私のギガバイトも\nあっという間になくなり\n1ギガバイト買ったの！きょう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大事に使わなきゃねっ！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/08/15/7039293/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分より年上のお姉さんメンバーに\nわちゃわちゃしてもらうのも\n嬉しいしうきうきして楽しいけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"同い年とか年下の先輩と\nわちゃわちゃするのも楽しくて\nずっと笑ってる！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"くだらないことをして"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「きい！！！」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「きいちゃん！！」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って言われるのが楽しい！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そういうふざけるのにものってくれるのは\nみり愛で前までは\nみり愛のふざけた時のテンションに\nついていけないくらいだったけど\n最近は若返ったのか\n同じペースでふざけてもちゃんと体力が\n残ってるの！！！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎日みんなと会って\nみんなの顔を見て思うのは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にメンバー全員だいすきってこと！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんなにだいすきになったり\nこんなに大切に思える存在になるって\n思わなかったくらい！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"四六時中みんなと一緒にいたい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夏のツアーはリハを含めると\n長い戦いだし、自分のダメなところや\n弱いところが見えてきたり\n辛いこともあるけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こうやってみんなと一緒にいれることや\nステージからみる皆さんの笑顔を見ると\n幸せだし楽しくてしょうがないです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから、ライブあとの\n必ず毎回起こる\nこの筋肉痛も心地いいくらい！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、ほんとになんでこんな筋肉痛なんだろう。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一応、何公演もやってきてるし\n今までもたくさん踊ってて\nいきなり激しく踊ったから！とか\nそういうことはしてないのに。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いまは、お腹が筋肉痛！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/08/15/7039293/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/08/15/7039293/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひなたぼっこ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/08/15/7039293/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは、きょうはこのへんで！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごいこと言ってもいいですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分のお誕生日のブログまだあげてない。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"へへへ(｡-∀-｡)♪"}],"source":"archive"}